    "detailed_description": "My name is Temple, I was a traversal specialist on an expedition.<br><br>We were studying a new artifact. Turns out it was a portal. Return is impossible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/45b0d1494b461613f0db1b3286127003.poster.avif?t=1715633229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/45b0d1494b461613f0db1b3286127003.webm?t=1715633229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/45b0d1494b461613f0db1b3286127003.mp4?t=1715633229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Momentum-Driven Parkour</h2><br>Grappling hooks, wings, hover boots, bounce pads, wall jumps, and more. Chain moves together to surmount complex obstacles. Stay the course, or make your own, for there are few true paths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Alternate Dimension</h2><br>Discover an otherwordly landscape of lava caverns and frozen landscapes. Depending on the path your choose, different locations will be found. <strong>This is a 3D metroidvania with no dead ends.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Gear</h2><br>Find new clothing options in the nooks and crannies of the world. Swap colors all you want, or mix and match hairstyles. Will you become a fearless explorer, or a strange girl with a mustache?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frightening Mystery</h2><br>Your not alone. In this beautiful world a powerful being searches for you in the dark. Gather your courage, and don a high tech visor to navigate the ruinous netherworld.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter into the Veil, the Alter Unknown</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/3001286a679a01afedc051fd0011a322.poster.avif?t=1715633229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/3001286a679a01afedc051fd0011a322.webm?t=1715633229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470800/extras/3001286a679a01afedc051fd0011a322.mp4?t=1715633229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
